# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

`last_execution_status`, `last_execution_date`, and `scheduled_task_id` are null when Kibana does not report them. A rule that has never executed, or whose last execution time cannot be parsed, has a null `last_execution_date`. A rule with no tags has `tags` as an empty set.

This data source replaces the removed `last_execution_status` and `last_execution_date` attributes on the `elasticstack_kibana_alerting_rule` resource.

In a space with many rules, set `filter` so each read does not page through every rule.

